    description: "STATEMENT: a C# call on a receiver nobody could type is bound by name only when the name is not one the BCL defines. OBSERVED: with the name step on, 314 new binds on six trees; of 15 read 10 right, 5 wrong (string.Join, task.AsTask(), stopwatch.Start()). ImportScope.library_names_screened is therefore not set by csharp.py and the single-holder name linker skips C# files. Cost: about 16 right single-holder calls of the 214 lost (extension methods on untyped chains). NEEDS: a predefined-type receiver (string.Join) reported as a qualifier; a list of BCL member names passed as stdlib_member_name; then set the flag and re-sample.\n\nEvidence and method: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/pilot_11252026/DESIGN.md and final/ (maps mine_e948 at e948d2ae3 against before/ at dev 0d3c12ff4; hand samples seed 20261125). Found during the ADR-0064 pilot (rust, csharp, javascript/typescript); not built there because fewer than two of the three pilot languages need it, or because it is the analyzer's own."  # 6996
